SU(2) global-payment period-potential exact audit

COMMAND
make -f Makefile.research analyze_su2_aim_period_potential
./analyze_su2_aim_period_potential 30 4

OUTPUT
SU2_AIM_PERIOD_POTENTIAL maximum_level=60 maximum_shell=4 payments=19360 potential_checks=6938560 potential_failures=0 period_monotonicity_checks=6016000 period_monotonicity_failures=0 initial_split_checks=922560 initial_split_failures=0 maximum_last_period_defect=28
